    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SkillWarz</strong> is a fast-paced, cross-platform first-person shooter featuring competitive multiplayer battles across web, mobile, and desktop. Currently, the game includes five action-packed modes (Deathmatch, Team Deathmatch, Gun Game, Team Gun Game, and Skull Hunt) set across more than 20 diverse maps. Choose from six unique classes and ten different weapons to dominate the battlefield. Additional content (including maps, weapons, and game modes) is planned for future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The browser version is already playable, with mobile and Steam releases planned soon. Wishlist now and stay tuned for updates!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SkillWarz</strong> is a fast-paced, cross-platform first-person shooter featuring competitive multiplayer battles across web, mobile, and desktop. Currently, the game includes five action-packed modes (Deathmatch, Team Deathmatch, Gun Game, Team Gun Game, and Skull Hunt) set across more than 20 diverse maps. Choose from six unique classes and ten different weapons to dominate the battlefield. Additional content (including maps, weapons, and game modes) is planned for future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The browser version is already playable, with mobile and Steam releases planned soon. Wishlist now and stay tuned for updates!</p>",
